POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json  

{
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "testpassword"
}

### Criação de um parceiro
POST http://localhost:3000/partners
Content-Type: application/json  

{
    "name": "Test Partner 4",
    "email": "testuser4xpto@example.com",
    "password": "testpassword",
    "company_name": "Test Company"
}

### Listagem de todos os parceiros
POST http://localhost:3000/customers
Content-Type: application/json  

{
    "name": "Test Customer 1",
    "email": "testcustomer@example.com",
    "password": "testpassword",
    "address": "123 Test St",
    "phone": "123-456-7890"
}

### Eventos
POST http://localhost:3000/events
Content-Type: application/json  

{
    "name": "Test Event 1",
    "description": "This is a test event.",
    "date": "2024-07-01T10:00:00Z",
    "location": "Test Venue",
} 
### Listagem de todos os eventos
GET http://localhost:3000/events

### Criação do evento pelo o parceiro
POST http://localhost:3000/partners/events
Content-Type: application/json  

{
    "name": "Test Event 1",
    "description": "This is a test event.",
    "date": "2024-07-01T10:00:00Z",
    "location": "Test Venue",
} 
### Listagem dos eventos criados pelo parceiro
GET http://localhost:3000/partners/events

### Listagem dos detalhes do evento criado pelo parceiro
GET http://localhost:3000/partners/events/1

